<title>USA: TABLE - Vectra Banking Q2 net increases.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Vectra Banking Q2 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the quarters ended	     For the years ended</p>
<p>	    Jun 30,    Mar 31,    Jun 30,    Jun 30,    Jun 30,</p>
<p>		 1997	1997	 1996	 1997	 1996</p>
<p>Net interest</p>
<p>  income    6,867	6,555	5,143     13,422	9,612</p>
<p>Provision for</p>
<p>loan losses</p>
<p>		  224	  230	  189	  454	  368</p>
