<p>  securities  (9)	 (31)	(163)	 (40)	(163)</p>
<p>Net earnings</p>
<p>		1,766	1,672	1,205	3,438	2,194</p>
<p>Preferred stock</p>
<p>  dividend    552	  377	  219	  929	  404</p>
<p>Net earnings</p>
<p>available</p>
<p>to common</p>
<p>shareholders</p>
<p>		1,214	1,295	  986	2,509	1,790</p>
<p>Earnings per average common share outstanding:</p>
<p>Earnings per common and common equivalent</p>
<p>  share	0.24	 0.26	 0.20	 0.50	 0.37</p>
